  "notes": "Original file: https://github.com/markmead/hyperui/blob/main/public/examples/templates/portfolio/1.html",
  "code": "<input class=\"peer sr-only\" id=\"nav-toggle\" type=\"checkbox\"/>\n<header class=\"sticky top-0 z-40 border-b border-gray-100 bg-white/90 backdrop-blur\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto flex h-16 max-w-5xl items-center justify-between px-4 sm:px-6\">\n<a class=\"text-sm font-semibold tracking-tight text-gray-900\" href=\"#\">\n          Guillermo de la Cruz\n        </a>\n<nav aria-label=\"Global\" class=\"hidden md:block\">\n<ul class=\"flex items-center gap-8 text-sm text-gray-600\">\n<li><a class=\"transition hover:text-gray-900\" href=\"#work\">Work</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"transition hover:text-gray-900\" href=\"#about\">About</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"transition hover:text-gray-900\" href=\"#contact\">Contact</a></li>\n</ul>\n</nav>\n<div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n<a class=\"hidden rounded-md bg-violet-600 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-white transition hover:bg-violet-700 sm:block\" href=\"#contact\">\n            Book a call\n          </a>\n<label aria-controls=\"mobile-nav\" aria-expanded=\"false\" class=\"cursor-pointer rounded-md p-2 text-gray-600 transition peer-focus-visible:ring-2 peer-focus-visible:ring-violet-600 peer-focus-visible:ring-offset-2 hover:bg-gray-100 md:hidden\" for=\"nav-toggle\" id=\"nav-toggle-label\">\n<span class=\"sr-only\">Toggle menu</span>\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"size-5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n<path d=\"M3.75 6.75h16.5M3.75 12h16.5m-16.5 5.25h16.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path>\n</svg>\n</label>\n</div>\n</div>\n<nav aria-label=\"Global Mobile\" class=\"hidden border-t border-gray-100 bg-white peer-checked:block md:hidden\" id=\"mobile-nav\">\n<ul class=\"space-y-1 px-4 py-4 text-sm\">\n<li>\n<a class=\"block rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-gray-600 hover:bg-gray-50\" href=\"#work\">Work</a>\n</li>\n<li>\n<a class=\"block rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-gray-600 hover:bg-gray-50\" href=\"#about\">About</a>\n</li>\n<li>\n<a class=\"block rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-gray-600 hover:bg-gray-50\" href=\"#contact\">Contact</a>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</nav>\n</header>\n<main>\n<section class=\"mx-auto max-w-5xl px-4 pt-16 pb-20 sm:px-6 sm:pt-20\">\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-gray-200 py-1 pr-3 pl-2 text-xs font-medium text-gray-600\">\n<span class=\"relative flex size-2\">\n<span class=\"absolute inline-flex size-full animate-ping rounded-full bg-emerald-400 opacity-75\"></span>\n<span class=\"relative inline-flex size-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500\"></span>\n</span>\n          Available for one new project in Q3\n        </span>\n<h1 class=\"mt-6 max-w-2xl text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-gray-900 sm:text-5xl\">\n          I help funded product teams ship decisions they can still defend a year later.\n        </h1>\n<p class=\"mt-5 max-w-xl text-lg text-pretty text-gray-600\">\n          Contract product designer working end-to-end — research, flows, UI, and the handoff\n          that keeps engineering from guessing. Based in Lisbon, working with teams everywhere.\n        </p>\n<div class=\"mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4\">\n<a class=\"rounded-md bg-violet-600 px-6 py-3 text-sm font-medium text-white transition hover:bg-violet-700\" href=\"#contact\">\n            Start a project\n          </a>\n<a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 transition hover:text-gray-900\" href=\"#work\">\n            See the work\n            <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"size-4 rtl:rotate-180\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n<path d=\"M13.5 4.5 21 12m0 0-7.5 7.5M21 12H3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path>\n</svg>\n</a>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"scroll-mt-16 border-t border-gray-100 bg-gray-50\" id=\"work\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto max-w-5xl px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 sm:py-20\">\n<div class=\"max-w-lg\">\n<p class=\"text-sm font-medium text-violet-600\">Selected work</p>\n<h2 class=\"mt-2 text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 sm:text-3xl\">\n              Three projects, three different kinds of hard problem.\n            </h2>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mt-12 space-y-16\">\n<article class=\"grid items-center gap-8 sm:grid-cols-2 sm:gap-12\">\n<img alt=\"\" class=\"aspect-4/3 w-full rounded-lg object-cover\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1553877522-43269d4ea984?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=80&amp;w=1160\"/>\n<div>\n<p class=\"text-xs font-medium tracking-wide text-gray-500 uppercase\">\n                  Fieldnote · Product design · 2025\n                </p>\n<h3 class=\"mt-2 text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900\">\n                  Redesigning the editor that field engineers actually trust\n                </h3>\n<p class=\"mt-3 text-gray-600\">\n                  Cut average report time from 11 minutes to 4 by rebuilding the note editor around\n                  offline-first sync, not adding features on top of it.\n                </p>\n<a class=\"mt-4 inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-sm font-medium text-violet-600 transition hover:text-violet-700\" href=\"#\">\n                  View case study\n                  <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"size-4 rtl:rotate-180\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n<path d=\"M13.5 4.5 21 12m0 0-7.5 7.5M21 12H3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path>\n</svg>\n</a>\n</div>\n</article>\n<article class=\"grid items-center gap-8 sm:grid-cols-2 sm:gap-12\">\n<div class=\"sm:order-last\">\n<img alt=\"\" class=\"aspect-4/3 w-full rounded-lg object-cover\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551288049-bebda4e38f71?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=80&amp;w=1160\"/>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p class=\"text-xs font-medium tracking-wide text-gray-500 uppercase\">\n                  Orbitly · 0→1 · 2024\n                </p>\n<h3 class=\"mt-2 text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900\">\n                  Taking a team dashboard from spreadsheet to shippable\n                </h3>\n<p class=\"mt-3 text-gray-600\">\n                  Designed the first version of Orbitly's workspace, from onboarding through\n                  billing, and stayed on through their seed round launch.\n                </p>\n<a class=\"mt-4 inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-sm font-medium text-violet-600 transition hover:text-violet-700\" href=\"#\">\n                  View case study\n                  <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"size-4 rtl:rotate-180\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n<path d=\"M13.5 4.5 21 12m0 0-7.5 7.5M21 12H3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path>\n</svg>\n</a>\n</div>\n</article>\n<article class=\"grid items-center gap-8 sm:grid-cols-2 sm:gap-12\">\n<img alt=\"\" class=\"aspect-4/3 w-full rounded-lg object-cover\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1522252234503-e356532cafd5?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=80&amp;w=1160\"/>\n<div>\n<p class=\"text-xs font-medium tracking-wide text-gray-500 uppercase\">\n                  Northwind Studio · Design system · 2023\n                </p>\n<h3 class=\"mt-2 text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900\">\n                  A component library three teams could actually share\n                </h3>\n<p class=\"mt-3 text-gray-600\">\n                  Unified four inconsistent product surfaces into one Figma and code library,\n                  reducing new-screen build time by roughly a third.\n                </p>\n<a class=\"mt-4 inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-sm font-medium text-violet-600 transition hover:text-violet-700\" href=\"#\">\n                  View case study\n                  <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"size-4 rtl:rotate-180\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n<path d=\"M13.5 4.5 21 12m0 0-7.5 7.5M21 12H3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path>\n</svg>\n</a>\n</div>\n</article>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"mx-auto max-w-5xl scroll-mt-16 px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 sm:py-20\" id=\"about\">\n<div class=\"grid gap-12 sm:grid-cols-5 sm:items-start\">\n<div class=\"sm:col-span-2\">\n<img alt=\"\" class=\"aspect-square w-full rounded-lg object-cover\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1580489944761-15a19d654956?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=80&amp;w=800\"/>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sm:col-span-3\">\n<p class=\"text-sm font-medium text-violet-600\">About</p>\n<h2 class=\"mt-2 text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 sm:text-3xl\">\n              Seven years in, still happiest in the messy middle of a project.\n            </h2>\n<p class=\"mt-4 text-gray-600\">\n              I spent four years as an in-house designer at two Series A startups before going\n              independent in 2021. Now I work with two or three teams a year, usually stepping in\n              right after a fundraise or right before one, when product decisions carry the most\n              weight.\n            </p>\n<dl class=\"mt-8 grid grid-cols-3 gap-4 border-t border-gray-200 pt-8\">\n<div>\n<dt class=\"text-xs text-gray-500\">Years independent</dt>\n<dd class=\"mt-1 text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900\">4</dd>\n</div>\n<div>\n<dt class=\"text-xs text-gray-500\">Products shipped</dt>\n<dd class=\"mt-1 text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900\">23</dd>\n</div>\n<div>\n<dt class=\"text-xs text-gray-500\">Repeat clients</dt>\n<dd class=\"mt-1 text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900\">9</dd>\n</div>\n</dl>\n<ul class=\"mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-2\">\n<li class=\"rounded-full bg-gray-100 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-gray-700\">\n                Product strategy\n              </li>\n<li class=\"rounded-full bg-gray-100 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-gray-700\">\n                Design systems\n              </li>\n<li class=\"rounded-full bg-gray-100 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-gray-700\">\n                User research\n              </li>\n<li class=\"rounded-full bg-gray-100 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-gray-700\">\n                Figma &amp; code\n              </li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"border-t border-gray-100 bg-gray-50\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 sm:py-20\">\n<figure class=\"text-center\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mx-auto size-8 text-violet-600\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n<path clip-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4.804 21.644A6.707 6.707 0 0 0 6 21.75a6.721 6.721 0 0 0 3.583-1.029c.774.182 1.584.279 2.417.279 5.322 0 9.75-3.97 9.75-9 0-5.03-4.428-9-9.75-9s-9.75 3.97-9.75 9c0 2.409 1.025 4.587 2.674 6.192.232.226.277.428.254.543a3.73 3.73 0 0 1-.814 1.686.75.75 0 0 0 .44 1.223ZM8.25 10.875a1.125 1.125 0 1 0 0 2.25 1.125 1.125 0 0 0 0-2.25ZM10.875 12a1.125 1.125 0 1 1 2.25 0 1.125 1.125 0 0 1-2.25 0Zm4.875-1.125a1.125 1.125 0 1 0 0 2.25 1.125 1.125 0 0 0 0-2.25Z\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\"></path>\n</svg>\n<blockquote class=\"mt-4\">\n<p class=\"text-xl font-medium text-pretty text-gray-900 sm:text-2xl\">\n                Guillermo asked harder questions in the first week than our last three hires\n                combined. The dashboard we shipped is still the one we point new hires to as\n                “how we build here.”\n              </p>\n</blockquote>\n<figcaption class=\"mt-6 flex items-center justify-center gap-3\">\n<img alt=\"\" class=\"size-10 rounded-full object-cover\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1573497019940-1c28c88b4f3e?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=80&amp;w=200\"/>\n<div class=\"text-left\">\n<p class=\"text-sm font-medium text-gray-900\">Priya Natarajan</p>\n<p class=\"text-sm text-gray-500\">Ops Lead, Orbitly</p>\n</div>\n</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"mx-auto max-w-5xl scroll-mt-16 px-4 py-16 sm:px-6 sm:py-20\" id=\"contact\">\n<div class=\"rounded-2xl bg-gray-900 px-6 py-12 text-center sm:px-12 sm:py-16\">\n<h2 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold text-white sm:text-3xl\">\n            Have a project taking shape?\n          </h2>\n<p class=\"mx-auto mt-3 max-w-md text-gray-400\">\n            I take on one new engagement at a time, usually starting four to six weeks out. Tell me\n            what you're building and I'll reply within two days.\n          </p>\n<div class=\"mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-4\">\n<a class=\"rounded-md bg-white px-6 py-3 text-sm font-medium text-gray-900 transition hover:bg-gray-100\" href=\"#\">\n              hello@guillermodelacruz.com\n            </a>\n<a class=\"rounded-md border border-gray-700 px-6 py-3 text-sm font-medium text-white transition hover:bg-gray-800\" href=\"#\">\n              Book a 20-minute call\n            </a>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n</main>\n<footer class=\"border-t border-gray-100\">\n<div class=\"mx-auto flex max-w-5xl flex-col items-center gap-4 px-4 py-8 sm:flex-row sm:justify-between sm:px-6\">\n<p class=\"text-sm text-gray-500\">© 2026 Guillermo de la Cruz. Lisbon, Portugal.</p>\n<ul class=\"flex items-center gap-5\">\n<li>\n<a class=\"text-sm text-gray-500 transition hover:text-gray-900\" href=\"#\">Dribbble</a>\n</li>\n<li>\n<a class=\"text-sm text-gray-500 transition hover:text-gray-900\" href=\"#\">LinkedIn</a>\n</li>\n<li>\n<a class=\"text-sm text-gray-500 transition hover:text-gray-900\" href=\"#\">Read.cv</a>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</footer>\n<script>\n      const navToggleCheckbox = document.getElementById('nav-toggle')\n      const navToggleLabel = document.getElementById('nav-toggle-label')\n\n      navToggleCheckbox.addEventListener('change', () => {\n        navToggleLabel.setAttribute('aria-expanded', String(navToggleCheckbox.checked))\n      })\n    </script>",
